  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "眠床跤ê石磨仔"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><span><b>作者：</b></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>吳義舜&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「阿媽、阿媽有tī--leh--無？」「Tī tsia--lah……」 阿媽探頭出來huah，「阿順--ā lín tńg--來--ah，來lim茶--lah！」二叔mā緊按泡茶間出來招呼逐家入去坐，進前就聽講二叔有整理一間泡茶間tsiânn sù-sī，今仔koh是第一擺入--來，二叔踮中ng泡茶，阿媽坐邊--a、丈人、丈姆、我、阮某kap查某囝拄好四代人四角頭。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">泡茶間仔佈置kah tsiânn雅氣，壁頂掛幾若幅二叔家己寫ê毛筆字kah畫作，西爿一座古早櫥仔架頂囥tsiânn濟茶鈷kap茶米，下跤層囥規排ê果子醋，有梅仔、 李仔、檸檬、楊桃……上特別是連hiam椒仔醋mā有，hōo我khah好玄--ê是看著壁角有一个大粒ê粗甕仔，下跤竟然是用一粒石磨仔kué跤。就問二叔，he tann愈來愈oh看--著--ah，怎樣iáu-koh有hit粒？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿媽就suà喙講起：「Khah早ê人，tsiânn濟mi̍h件lóng是規公族kong-ke輪流用，親像鼓井、phòng-phuh、e粿ê石磨仔，tsit个石磨仔就是kap伯公in kong-ke用--ê。講著lín伯公，做人tsiânn無量，見擺伊若代先e好，就kā石磨手提去藏，逐擺lóng ài hōo我揣規晡。有一擺愈超過，竟然提去藏tī厝後ê竹bôo跤！啊好！我khí-moo bái，tī後一擺就拚透早tsa̍h頭前先去e，e好規氣kā頂沿tsit塊石磨仔mooh去眠床跤藏。講到無量，hit時伊有一台兩輪ê li-á-khah，見若割稻仔ê時想beh kā伊借--一-下，mā是ài三koo-tsiânn四拜託。落尾氣--著，牙齒根咬--leh，殘殘kā hak一台三輪--ê，換我mā bē giàn借--伊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Khah早lán khah散作無幾分田，hōo人看khah無目地，mā因為án-ne kap lín阿公兩个真認份，拍拚作，骨力儉，緊作緊儉，有粟仔會就mî-nuā tuè。Hit時tsūn，若拍拚儉幾冬仔，標一、兩个會仔就ē-sái買一坵田--ah，阮就án-ne一坵一坵khuann-khuann仔粒積，tann tsiah有tsit幾甲田thang留hōo lín pâ in……」&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit下晡二叔ê茶tsiânn清芳、阿媽ê故事koh-khah甘甜。阿媽徛tī門口手ná ia̍t ná huah：「駛khah慢--leh，有閒就khah tsia̍p tńg--來--leh！」越頭問阮某，阿媽tann幾歲--ah，伊講：「Tann kánn-ná 95 iah是96--ooh！」</span></p><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgQsVC-0p1HOwRuH42W73hdBDoerO2zS_LLtkDuo-x0AYjX81xYrVT8iX72C5i6zO6n6jDGth8EghNcS9UniFCRsp_BbcLmh04bgbsEFbnwDmnD8ekhzkoWXREYKV6Sfpj8IpBSMWkvBR246uO_jldyLisRspG1KHLWdLdmTxQE-CgIt2uwV8bngUAIcg/s2847/339%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2847\" data-original-width=\"2000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgQsVC-0p1HOwRuH42W73hdBDoerO2zS_LLtkDuo-x0AYjX81xYrVT8iX72C5i6zO6n6jDGth8EghNcS9UniFCRsp_BbcLmh04bgbsEFbnwDmnD8ekhzkoWXREYKV6Sfpj8IpBSMWkvBR246uO_jldyLisRspG1KHLWdLdmTxQE-CgIt2uwV8bngUAIcg/w450-h640/339%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiQImE5_7xT8LWCgDUYz8JMccliBK1UygfIGAg-q5O4BwLBbIeIXJ1vxlBcSWyl9b830bn025ZUYglZl2ICnabIalyXB5VinwUfmCRYzfa3PUXT3qUQg6hddqmYkp3i6sRxDX7Zp4yNIUkQwF5aia7GtyUizKOBXuJog-oueItfsx5b_JjmWk_UMDqr2w/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1339%E6%9C%9F_17.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiQImE5_7xT8LWCgDUYz8JMccliBK1UygfIGAg-q5O4BwLBbIeIXJ1vxlBcSWyl9b830bn025ZUYglZl2ICnabIalyXB5VinwUfmCRYzfa3PUXT3qUQg6hddqmYkp3i